    "summary": "A complete tweening and animation engine for CometEngine, modelled on DOTween.",
    "description": "# Tweeny\n\nTweeny animates anything over time: positions, rotations, scales, colours, alpha, UI, audio, materials and any value you can read and write.\n\nIt is a full port of DOTween adapted to CometEngine and AngelScript, with easings, sequences, paths, punch and shake, callbacks, coroutine integration and an inspector-driven animation component.",
